            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# CodexMate 0.0.36

- Reads Codex Desktop state from the current `~/.codex/sqlite` storage directory as well as the legacy `~/.codex` location.
- Keeps state database failures visible instead of silently moving on to another database when a selected candidate cannot be read.
- Updates remote thread metadata reads to use the same storage discovery behavior as local Codex Desktop state reads.
]]></description>
